('physics-shm-01','physics','waves','Oscillations','Simple harmonic motion','In simple harmonic motion, acceleration a and displacement x satisfy:','["a=−ω²x","a=ωx","a=ω²/x","a is constant"]',0,'SHM has a restoring acceleration proportional and opposite to displacement: a=−ω²x.','foundation',array['jee-main','tg-eapcet','ap-eapcet'],'published','NCERT Physics XI; official JEE Main and EAPCET syllabi',now(),'codex-phase3-review','1.0'),
